Third-party material
--------------------

- Bluetooth protocol (src/protocol.rs, src/device.rs, src/live.rs, src/offline.rs): translated from
  Tuhi (https://github.com/tuhiproject/tuhi), GPL-2.0-or-later, by the Tuhi contributors.

- User interface (src/ui/theme.rs, src/ui/widgets.rs, src/ui/chrome.rs, src/ui/backstage.rs):
  layout, measurements, colour tokens and ruler logic adapted from WordCraft
  (https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft, crates/ui-egui),
  Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the WordCraft contributors,
  licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License, Version 2.0, at your option.
  The ArtCraft/WordCraft names and logos are not used.

- Word and PDF documents (src/wordsign.rs, src/docrender.rs): the WordCraft engine crate
  (wordcraft-engine, https://github.com/storytold/wordcraft) and the PdfCraft renderer crate
  (pdfcraft-render, https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft), used as library dependencies at a
  fixed revision, together with the patched third-party crates they use (see [patch.crates-io]
  in Cargo.toml).
  Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the WordCraft / PdfCraft contributors,
  licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License, Version 2.0, at your option.

- VectorCraft (https://github.com/storytold/vectorcraft): the vectorcraft-engine crate opens SVG
  images and saves them with the pen strokes. Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the
  VectorCraft contributors, licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License, Version 2.0, at
  your option. Used unmodified from GitHub at a fixed revision.

- PhotoCraft (https://github.com/storytold/photocraft): the photocraft-codecs, -paint, -raster,
  -color and -geom crates read and write photos (PNG, JPEG, WebP, TIFF…) and draw the pen strokes
  on them. Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the PhotoCraft contributors, licensed under the MIT
  License or the Apache License, Version 2.0, at your option. Used unmodified from GitHub at a
  fixed revision.

- Typst (https://github.com/typst/typst), Copyright (c) 2023 The Typst Project Developers,
  Apache License 2.0: the typst, typst-layout and typst-render crates draw the LaTeX formulas
  of Markdown documents (src/mathtex.rs) and the AI chat's charts. typst-render and typst-svg
  0.15.1 are copied in vendor/ with one change each (see vendor/README.md). The New Computer
  Modern fonts the formulas use (GUST Font License) are copied unmodified from the typst-assets
