  Bundled unmodified in src/typst-pkg/ with their licence files; they draw the AI chat's charts.

- The MCP servers of the Craft suite (wordcraft-mcp, pdfcraft-automation, vectorcraft-mcp,
  photocraft-automation;
  ArtCraft Team, MIT OR Apache-2.0) run in-process, unmodified, so the AI chat can read and edit
  the document open next to it.

- MiTeX (https://github.com/mitex-rs/mitex), the MiTeX contributors, Apache License 2.0: the
  mitex crate converts LaTeX formulas to Typst; the Typst definitions of its package are
