  consent, and checks its SHA-256 (via the openh264 crate, BSD-2-Clause). It is not distributed
  with OpenSlate. OpenH264 Video Codec provided by Cisco Systems, Inc.
  (licence: https://www.openh264.org/BINARY_LICENSE.txt). macOS and Windows use their own system
